    "组合数学"
  ],
  "summary": "把高度一到 n 的不同木棍排成一排，求从左侧恰能看到 k 根的排列数量并取模。",
  "insight": "放入最高木棍：若放最左边会新增一个可见木棍，对应 dp[n-1][k-1]；放在其余 n-1 个位置会挡住后方但不改变可见数，对应 (n-1)*dp[n-1][k]。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "木棍高度互不相同",
    "最高木棍放首位才新增可见数",
    "乘法使用 long 并及时取模"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "visible-stick-combinational-dp",
      "title": "最高木棍位置 DP",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "按木棍数量递推可见数量。",
      "steps": [
        "dp[0][0]=1",
        "length 从 1 到 n，visible 从 1 到 min(length,k)",
        "dp[length][visible]=dp[length-1][visible-1]+(length-1)*dp[length-1][visible]，取模"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(nk)",
        "space": "O(nk)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/visible-stick-combinational-dp/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/visible-stick-combinational-dp/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/visible-stick-combinational-dp/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
